{
  "failure_location": "objective",
  "root_cause_hypothesis": "The optimizer is being driven by secondary exploration objectives because the primary 'performance' objective returns zero for all evaluated candidates (performance mean=0.0000, std=0.0000, best=0.0000). This may be due to a failing/misconfigured performance scorer or an extremely sparse nonzero-performance region; I am uncertain which.",
