  "rationale": "Observable evidence: performance is uniformly zero across 32 candidates (mean=0.0000, std=0.0000, best=0.0000), while distance_from_center and parameter_spread have increased (means 0.3896 and 0.3732, improved by +0.0048 and +0.0059). The optimizer is therefore effectively optimizing the secondary objectives. Removing the secondary objectives (rather than more speculative changes) will allow any small/nonzero performance signals to dominate selection and reveal whether the performance scorer produces usable values.",
  "proposed_change": {
